$\quad \quad x_{B1} \geq 0.25(x_{B1} + x_{B2} + x_{B3})$ 
$\quad \quad x_{B2} \leq 0.5(x_{B1} + x_{B2} + x_{B3})$ 

**4. Non-negativity** 
$\quad \quad x_{ij} \geq 0 \quad \forall i,j$
